  <section>
    <h2>Published</h2>
    <div class="callout">
      <span class="callout-label">Essay §0</span>
      <h3><a href="/en/essays/buddhism-as-coordinate-system/">Buddhism as a Coordinate System — A New Computational Foundation for Understanding the Human</a></h3>
      <p>Starting from my methodological concern about neuroscience-centered approaches, this essay lays out my argument for adopting the 2,500 years of internal Buddhist observation as a computable coordinate system. The fundamental purpose of my research program. Level 1 (methodological tier).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="callout">
      <span class="callout-label">Essay §13</span>
      <h3><a href="/en/essays/external-prefrontal-cortex/">The External Prefrontal Cortex (ExPFC) — An AI Device that Externally Substitutes for a Compromised Prefrontal Cortex</a></h3>
      <p>Scam victimization redefined neuroscientifically as a temporary functional failure of the prefrontal cortex, and the AI device — ExPFC — that externally substitutes for a compromised PFC. A proposal from applied neuroscience standing at the intersection of neuroethics and AI Safety.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="callout">
      <span class="callout-label">Essay §14</span>
      <h3><a href="/en/essays/bonno-embedding/">Bonnō Embedding and the Scam-Detection Mechanism — Mapping Text into a Vector Space of Psychological Vulnerability</a></h3>
      <p>A detection mechanism built around a function f mapping text into a 108-dimensional vector of mental-affliction stimulation, composite-judged with a law-grounded check on source attribution. Addressed equally to Affective Computing researchers and to anti-scam practitioners.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="callout">
      <span class="callout-label">Essay §15</span>
      <h3><a href="/en/essays/precision-economics/">Economies of Precision vs Economies of Scale — The Domain Big AI Cannot Enter</a></h3>
      <p>How I deliberately position my research program in the domain that Big AI is structurally barred from entering. Level 2 (strategic tier).</p>
    </div>
  </section>

